3200
02:55:47,580 --> 02:55:50,680
あのさ これさ お主らに分かってほしい話するね
Listen, I want to talk about something I really want you all to understand.

3201
02:55:51,080 --> 02:55:54,080
お主らに共感してほしい話するね わし今から
I'm gonna talk about something I want you all to sympathize with right now.

3202
02:55:54,480 --> 02:55:57,480
あのさ「一番好きな曲」ってムズくないか？
Listen, isn't picking a "favorite song" super hard?

3203
02:55:58,280 --> 02:56:00,080
1選って無理じゃない？
Isn't picking just one impossible?

3204
02:56:00,080 --> 02:56:02,280
1選って無理なのじゃ！
Picking just one is impossible!

3205
02:56:02,280 --> 02:56:04,480
何で無理か？何で無理か？
Why is it impossible? Why is it impossible?

3206
02:56:04,680 --> 02:56:06,280
あのね
Well, you see...

3207
02:56:09,780 --> 02:56:13,280
ジャンルが違うものをね 比較できない
You can't compare things that are in totally different genres.

3208
02:56:13,380 --> 02:56:14,480
うん
Yeah.

3209
02:56:15,780 --> 02:56:19,680
なんか本当にさ ジャンル違うものって無理じゃん
Seriously, comparing different genres is just impossible, right?

3210
02:56:19,780 --> 02:56:23,780
なんかあの「ハンバーグとクッキーどっちが好きですか？」とかって無理じゃん
Like, asking "Do you prefer hamburger steak or cookies?" is impossible, right?

3211
02:56:23,780 --> 02:56:25,780
同じ食べ物だけど
Even though they're both food.

3212
02:56:25,780 --> 02:56:28,280
同じ食べ物だけどさ いや それは違うやんって
Even though they're both food, it's like, "No, that's completely different!"

3213
02:56:28,280 --> 02:56:30,780
なんかハンバーグと唐揚げとかなら分かるけどさ
Like, if it were hamburger steak vs fried chicken, I'd get it, but...

3214
02:56:31,080 --> 02:56:32,680
そう ベクトルが違う！
Right, the vector is completely different!

3215
02:56:33,280 --> 02:56:36,780
なんか スイーツとおかず比べるのお前 みたいな
Like, "Dude, you're comparing sweets to a dinner dish?"

3216
02:56:36,780 --> 02:56:38,780
ならん？
Doesn't that happen?

3217
02:56:40,280 --> 02:56:41,780
そう みたいな感じで
Yeah. So in that same way...

3218
02:56:42,080 --> 02:56:47,580
あの活動が長ければ長いほど その時期によって曲調って違うじゃろう？
The longer someone has been active, the more their musical style varies by era, right?

3219
02:56:48,280 --> 02:56:51,780
なら 例えば あの なんだろう
So, for example, um, how should I put it...

3220
